      "writtenOn": "2017-08-02T19:59:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So you are relying on the wake mask always being set by an SMI handler? And you don\u0027t care if s0ix settings blow away previously set ones?",
      "parentUuid": "764db433_4e2084d6",
      "revId": "db5ea47f0cb36c97e70309d8a5189a3f8184e43b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
