      "message": "Yes, SMI handler sets wake mask and coreboot clears the mask on resume (/boot) with google_chromeec_set_wake_mask(0).\nSo EC always rely on the wake mask set by SMI handler (in S3/S5)",
      "parentUuid": "1780019e_42df48d0",
